                <pb facs="0883" n="763" sameAs="frus:frus1905/pg763"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Ambassador
                    McCormick.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-02-18"><hi rendition="#italic">February 18,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay instructs Mr. McCormick to convey fitting expression of condolence upon
                    the death of Grand Duke Sergius and the abhorrence of the act felt by the
                    President and the Government of the United States.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
